        "content": "<p>My registration was accepted, but doesn't seem to show up on the homepage, and the link I was provided errors:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">...</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">21</span><span class=\"n\">T04</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">42</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">57</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Prepared</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">registry</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">record</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">registration</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pending</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">review</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">database</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">change</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">21</span><span class=\"n\">T04</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">44</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">22</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Registered</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PALOMAR</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\"