        "content": "<p>Hey <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> loving this project! Adding a +1 to this, I’m also seeing the same results for a few of my successful submissions, e.g.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://palomar-registry.org/entry.html?id=PALOMAR-2026-08-21-000002&amp;version=1\">https://palomar-registry.org/entry.html?id=PALOMAR-2026-08-21-000002&amp;version=1</a> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://palomar-registry.org/entry.html?id=PALOMAR-2026-08-21-000011&amp;version=1\">https://palomar-registry.org/entry.html?id=PALOMAR-2026-08-21-000011&amp;version=1</a></p>\n<p>In case it’s useful for debugging, the homepage has been showing “19 registered results | 17 source projects” since yesterday (even after my submissions were  successfully registered) so maybe all registered results for 2026-08-21 are missing?</p>",
